,"updated_at":"2025-12-12T21:09:47Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-09T01:30:33Z","git_url":"git://github.com/syncthing/syncthing.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:syncthing/syncthing.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing","homepage":"https://syncthing.net/","size":124515,"stargazers_count":78228,"watchers_count":78228,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":4850,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":377,"license":{"key":"mpl-2.0","name":"Mozilla Public License 2.0","spdx_id":"MPL-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mpl-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTE0"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":true,"topics":["go","p2p","peer-to-peer","synchronization"],"visibility":"public","forks":4850,"open_issues":377,"watchers":78228,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Hi folks,\r\n\r\nI'm upgrading the OpenBSD package to 1.4.2. All is well, but just occasionally (i.e. non-deterministically) I'm able to get kqueue-related test failures like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\nruntime: kevent on fd 13 failed with 9\r\nfatal error: runtime: netpoll failed\r\n\r\nruntime stack:\r\nruntime.throw(0xd17db9, 0x17)\r\n\t/usr/local/go/src/runtime/panic.go:774 +0x72\r\nruntime.netpoll(0x47173ead79400, 0x1)\r\n\t/usr/local/go/src/runtime/netpoll_kqueue.go:77 +0x253\r\nruntime.startTheWorldWithSema(0xffffffffffffff00, 0x217314f58)\r\n\t/usr/local/go/src/runtime/proc.go:1083 +0x236\r\nruntime.gcStart.func2()\r\n\t/usr/local/go/src/runtime/mgc.go:1347 +0x35\r\nruntime.systemstack(0x2376c82f0)\r\n\t/usr/local/go/src/runtime/asm_amd64.s:370 +0x66\r\nruntime.mstart()\r\n\t/usr/local/go/src/runtime/proc.go:1146\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\n[Full test output](https://gist.github.com/vext01/a431a623e76f